<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Shared `previewImage` fallback for both widgets, API 26-30 only (ROADMAP M5 T5;
  `res/xml/today_widget_info.xml`, `res/xml/month_widget_info.xml`). API 31-34 shows the real static
  mock-up (`res/layout/*_widget_preview.xml`) instead, and API 35+ shows the bitmap
  `providePreview`/`setWidgetPreview` renders (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §5 "Picker previews"), so this is a
  legacy-only fallback: a simple vector, not a Roborazzi-captured bitmap (the task's explicit
  simplification over the doc's original "generated from a Roborazzi capture"; no binary asset is
  needed here. A rounded card echoing the brand launcher mark's dot-row-plus-pill motif
  (`core/designsystem/.../drawable/ic_intercalary.xml`), tinted with the brand teal so it reads at a
  glance as "this app", without depicting either widget's exact layout (which the two real preview paths
  above already do more precisely).
-->
